                    "Welcome to Day 48 of AI & Digital Transformation for Business. Over the past two days, we engineered cloud-scale inference systems: high-throughput continuous batching on Day 46 and sub-200ms speculative decoding on Day 47. Today, we cross the architectural frontier from centralized hyperscaler datacenters to physical edge computing. We explore how to deploy high-throughput, generative AI cognitive micro-engines directly onto embedded edge silicon—powering autonomous industrial robots, offshore oil rigs, surgical robotic suites, avionics cockpits, and next-generation mobile devices.",
